// @m3, hq, n));`). Row 2's first form (P1) accepted it, a freed read (236 at -O0 and -O2, 97 under the detector), since its store's walk reached
// the pointer parameter above its last hop and read as a store INTO its pointee; found by the attack on that form (rulings l.17701). The callee:
